          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sai Agiriffa ya ce wa Festus, \"Da ba don wannan mutum ya ɗaukaka ƙara zuwa gaban Kaisar ba da an sake shi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
